tests:
I ran four test files with `npx tsx --test` from the repo root:
- tests/work-deliverables.test.ts: 15/15 pass. Covers generation and re-open for each kind, docx/xlsx/pptx/report/site contents, script injection, inert citation links, bundle traversal, stored-name judging, byte cap, schema refusal and builder refusal.
- tests/work-report-preview.test.ts: 15/15 pass. Covers the renderer's assumed properties, currency, brackets, backslash, images, links, raw HTML, code spans, truncation and canPreviewArtifact's kind list.
- tests/work-spreadsheet-preview.test.ts: 15/15 pass. Covers grid read-back, dates, row/column windowing, cell cap and non-workbook bytes.
- tests/artifact-export-verification.test.ts: 15/15 pass. Covers the chat Office export verified by the Work validator.

NOT COVERED by any test (searched tests/ for the api/work/artifacts routes and the components):
- the POST/GET/download/preview routes, including hash mismatch, replay and kind conflict;
- the runner's storeDeliverable;
- useWorkArtifactList refetch semantics (defect 4);
- WorkDeliverableStage and WorkDeliverablePreview dispatch (defect 15);
- account-deletion purge of deliverable objects;
- site-validator false positives (defect 3);
- deck overflow;
- markdown list-item escaping.

Scratch probes, run read-only from the scratchpad against the real generators, confirmed the defects marked VERIFIED:
- OOXML hashes differ across generations.
- Site prose false positives.
- The 20-row deck table has auto-height rows at y=1.4in.
- The docx subtitle comes before the H1.
- Date-only ISO is rejected.
- Report list/quote escaping gaps.
- The spreadsheet preview ignores numFmt.
